          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok aneno, ci awinyo ocur mo tye ka koko ki dwan maloŋo,, i kare ma onoŋo en tye ka tuk i dye yamo kun kok ni, “Can, can, can i wi jo ma bedo i lobo, pi dwan tum mukene ma pud gudoŋ ma lumalaika adek doŋ gicok kutone!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.13"
            ]
          }
